    "rengoku:STGZ3REN_00027:00003": {
      "text": "　\n　\n　~Inside Sidereal Base: Hangar~",
      "status": "draft",
      "source_sha": "89ceb17c5b",
      "source_member_sha256": "0d10e4e5d984d26c2a36284535bbbbebbae80efb3ee01947a48abf85fea3d68b",
      "notes": [
        "Location banner (pid_MUZIN); kept centering spacing approximate, translated text only."
      ]
    },
    "rengoku:STGZ3REN_00027:00004": {
      "text": "$$アドヴェント$$\n「...Stay alert.\n　$$サイデリアル$$ has withdrawn, but there's no telling\n　what they've left behind」",
      "status": "draft",
      "source_sha": "32137ba61e",
      "source_member_sha256": "0d10e4e5d984d26c2a36284535bbbbebbae80efb3ee01947a48abf85fea3d68b",
      "notes": []
    },
    "rengoku:STGZ3REN_00027:00005": {
      "text": "$$ランド$$\n「If that bug from earlier shows up\n　in the flesh, I don't think I could take it」",
      "status": "draft",
      "source_sha": "44b4069672",
      "source_member_sha256": "0d10e4e5d984d26c2a36284535bbbbebbae80efb3ee01947a48abf85fea3d68b",
      "notes": []
    },
    "rengoku:STGZ3REN_00027:00006": {
      "text": "$$クロウ$$\n「Just in case, we had $$セツコ$$ wait\n　in the rear, but I'd rather we skip\n　meeting one ourselves too」",
      "status": "draft",
      "source_sha": "641c26ade3",
      "source_member_sha256": "0d10e4e5d984d26c2a36284535bbbbebbae80efb3ee01947a48abf85fea3d68b",
      "notes": []
    },
    "rengoku:STGZ3REN_00027:00007": {
      "text": "$$クロウ$$\n「Who's there!?」",
      "status": "draft",
      "source_sha": "16ba48bd69",
      "source_member_sha256": "0d10e4e5d984d26c2a36284535bbbbebbae80efb3ee01947a48abf85fea3d68b",
      "notes": []
    },
    "rengoku:STGZ3REN_00027:00008": {
      "text": "$$クラヴィア$$\n「I-I'm sorry, I'm sorry!\n　P-please don't shoot!!」",
      "status": "draft",
      "source_sha": "82d86134ac",
      "source_member_sha256": "0d10e4e5d984d26c2a36284535bbbbebbae80efb3ee01947a48abf85fea3d68b",
      "notes": []
    },
    "rengoku:STGZ3REN_00027:00009": {
      "text": "$$クロウ$$\n「That depends on what you do from here」",
      "status": "draft",
      "source_sha": "dc5ceb01ac",
      "source_member_sha256": "0d10e4e5d984d26c2a36284535bbbbebbae80efb3ee01947a48abf85fea3d68b",
      "notes": []
    },
    "rengoku:STGZ3REN_00027:00010": {
      "text": "$$クラヴィア$$\n「Y-yeh, yes...!」",
      "status": "draft",
      "source_sha": "3b54c9721e",
      "source_member_sha256": "0d10e4e5d984d26c2a36284535bbbbebbae80efb3ee01947a48abf85fea3d68b",
      "notes": []
    },
    "rengoku:STGZ3REN_00027:00011": {
      "text": "$$ランド$$\n「You didn't stay behind\n　to ambush us... right?」",
      "status": "draft",
      "source_sha": "e6b113de42",
      "source_member_sha256": "0d10e4e5d984d26c2a36284535bbbbebbae80efb3ee01947a48abf85fea3d68b",
      "notes": []
    },
    "rengoku:STGZ3REN_00027:00012": {
      "text": "$$クロウ$$\n「If that's the case, we're being underestimated」",
      "status": "draft",
      "source_sha": "64ff4038ad",
      "source_member_sha256": "0d10e4e5d984d26c2a36284535bbbbebbae80efb3ee01947a48abf85fea3d68b",
      "notes": []
    },
    "rengoku:STGZ3REN_00027:00013": {
      "text": "$$クラヴィア$$\n「U-um...!\n　You're $$クロウ・ブルースト$$, aren't you!\n　And you over there, you're $$ランド・トラビス$$!」",
      "status": "draft",
      "source_sha": "a43c466635",
      "source_member_sha256": "0d10e4e5d984d26c2a36284535bbbbebbae80efb3ee01947a48abf85fea3d68b",
      "notes": []
    },
    "rengoku:STGZ3REN_00027:00014": {
      "text": "$$クロウ$$\n「Uh, yeah...」",
      "status": "draft",
      "source_sha": "00a63387f7",
      "source_member_sha256": "0d10e4e5d984d26c2a36284535bbbbebbae80efb3ee01947a48abf85fea3d68b",
      "notes": []
    },
    "rengoku:STGZ3REN_00027:00015": {
      "text": "$$ランド$$\n「Us... could we be famous or something?」",
      "status": "draft",
      "source_sha": "13237a42f1",
      "source_member_sha256": "0d10e4e5d984d26c2a36284535bbbbebbae80efb3ee01947a48abf85fea3d68b",
      "notes": []
    },
    "rengoku:STGZ3REN_00027:00016": {
      "text": "$$アドヴェント$$\n「Just who are you...」",
      "status": "draft",
      "source_sha": "ca703e7052",
      "source_member_sha256": "0d10e4e5d984d26c2a36284535bbbbebbae80efb3ee01947a48abf85fea3d68b",
      "notes": []
    },
    "rengoku:STGZ3REN_00027:00017": {
      "text": "$$クラヴィア$$\n「M-my name is $$クラヴィア・アーゴ$$...」",
      "status": "draft",
      "source_sha": "9dd3011e17",
      "source_member_sha256": "0d10e4e5d984d26c2a36284535bbbbebbae80efb3ee01947a48abf85fea3d68b",
      "notes": []
    },
    "rengoku:STGZ3REN_00027:00018": {
      "text": "$$クラヴィア$$\n「I was researching $$スフィア$$ at this base」",
      "status": "draft",
      "source_sha": "bf4a321904",
      "source_member_sha256": "0d10e4e5d984d26c2a36284535bbbbebbae80efb3ee01947a48abf85fea3d68b",
      "notes": []
    },
    "rengoku:STGZ3REN_00027:00019": {
      "text": "$$クロウ$$\n「$$スフィア$$...」",
      "status": "draft",
      "source_sha": "bf91a31612",
      "source_member_sha256": "0d10e4e5d984d26c2a36284535bbbbebbae80efb3ee01947a48abf85fea3d68b",
      "notes": []
    },
    "rengoku:STGZ3REN_00027:00020": {
      "text": "Facility Corridor",
      "status": "draft",
      "source_sha": "7e193a4a43",
      "source_member_sha256": "0d10e4e5d984d26c2a36284535bbbbebbae80efb3ee01947a48abf85fea3d68b",
